    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Tools from someone who's done the job</h1>
    <p class="lead">Mapped &amp; Managed makes structured-literacy and special-education resources for the people who actually run intervention — literacy interventionists, reading specialists, and SPED case managers.</p>

    <p>Everything here started as something that had to exist for a real caseload. The store is built and run by a 25-year educator with dual master's degrees in Educational Technology and Educational Administration, and every resource is designed to be technically correct first and pretty second — because the people using these tools are specialists who notice when the phonics is wrong.</p>

    <h2>What the name means</h2>
    <p>Two jobs, two halves of the brand. <strong>Mapped</strong> is the literacy side: mapping sounds to print with word-mapping mats, decodable passages, and explicit decoding routines. <strong>Managed</strong> is the documentation side: keeping IEP data, goals, and caseloads organized and defensible. <em>Teach it clearly. Track it simply.</em></p>

    <h2>Three lanes</h2>
    <ul class="checks" style="--accent:{{ site.colors.sage }}">
      <li><strong>Mapped Literacy</strong> — Science-of-Reading word mapping and decodable reading.</li>
      <li><strong>Managed IEP</strong> — IEP documentation and progress monitoring.</li>
      <li><strong>Teacher Systems</strong> — scheduling, planning, and tracking for interventionists.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout mt-2" style="--accent:{{ site.colors.coral }}">
      <h3>Where to start</h3>
      <p>Try a <a href="/free-tools/">free tool</a> from any lane, or browse the whole catalog on <a href="{{ site.tptStore }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Teachers Pay Teachers</a>.</p>
